{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30616","headline":"风不鸣条 · 王甚夷","name":"风不鸣条","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"圣日祥风起，韶晖助发生。\n蒙蒙遥野色，褭褭细条轻。\n荏弱看渐动，怡和吹不鸣。\n枝含余露湿，林霁晓烟平。\n缥缈春光媚，悠扬景气晴。\n康哉帝尧代，寰宇共澄清。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王甚夷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30616.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30616","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}